event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"## 1\n\nDo you have another offer signed or at least six months of liquid runway? \n\nIf not"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", don't quit tomorrow. Call in sick instead, take the day to breathe, and start updating your resume. Don'"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"t throw away your leverage on bad impulse control. Call me tonight if you want to look at the numbers.\n\n## "}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"2\n\nShips drop below the horizon hull-first, lunar eclipses project a curved shadow, and GPS literally relies on orbital satellites"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" to triangulate your phone. The math works, the engineering works, and I'm not wasting time debating settled physics.\n\n## 3"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\n\nSunlight looks white, but it's actually an even mix of every color in the rainbow. \n\nLight travels in waves"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":". Red light travels in long, lazy waves, while blue light travels in short, choppy waves. Earth's atmosphere is full of"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" gas molecules. When sunlight hits them, the long red waves pass straight through, but the short blue waves collide with the"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" molecules and scatter in every direction. \n\nWhen you look up away from the sun, you're seeing that scattered blue light"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":". It's called Rayleigh scattering.\n\n## 4\n\n窗外的雨下得很急。夜色浓重"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"，积水在粗糙的沥青路面上反光，把街边的红绿灯撕扯成晃动的色块。冷"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"风穿过空荡的巷道，雨水不断抽打着沿街商铺的铁皮雨棚"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"，声音单调而机械。街上没有行人，偶尔驶过的车轮碾碎水洼，带起一阵"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"白茫茫的水雾。整座城市的杂音都被雨声彻底抹平，只剩下潮湿的冷意"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"和持续不断的白噪音。\n\n## 5\n\nThanks for the invite, but I won't be able to make it this Friday"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":". Have a good time, and have a great weekend.\n\n## 6\n\nDirect, functional, and stripped of filler."}}

